  unitName: Sky King Falma
  unitId: 40103
  unitNumber: 130
  description: A mighty dual-wielding knight that belonged to the ruined Atharva
    Republic's cavalry. During the battle with the gods, he battled along side his
    friend, Sky Boss Grafl, on his airship. He had always been good at mid-air fighting,
    so his soldiers called him the Sky King. Legend has it that he defeated god after
    god by fearlessly leaping onto their backs and attacking.
  summonDesc: My right hand is justice, <br>my left is friendship.<br>But who do
    my blades shine for?
  fusionDesc: My dual blades harness <br>the strength of friendship!<br>That's how
    I got so strong!
  evoDesc: Look! See my dual blades shine!<br>That is the light of friendship, tempered
    with my friends!
  element: 4
  rarity: 3
